[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_03_0010","text":"（带什么去好呢～，慰问品……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_03_0020","text":"（闪电泡芙……！　布丁……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_03_0030","text":"甜甜圈！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_03_0040","text":"（甜甜圈……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_03_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_03_0050","text":"铜锣烧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_03_0060","text":"（铜锣烧……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_03_0070","text":"（今天的果穗最想要哪一个呢……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_03_0080","text":"（和菓子店在那边\n　甜甜圈的话有期间限定的摊位──）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_03_0090","text":"（……要是有铜锣烧甜甜圈之类的──\n　嗯……？　那不就是豆沙甜甜圈……？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_03_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_03_0100","text":"（──实际看了哪个好吃就买哪个！）"}]
